38 \\n                                                                        33.125 \\n                                                                        45.012 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                            a. Op basis van mjp vorig boekjaar \\n                                                                        -5.423 \\n                                                                        2.864 \\n                                                                        12.051 \\n                                                                        22.138 \\n                                                                        33.125 \\n                                                                        45.012 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                        VII. Gecumuleerd budgettair resultaat \\n                                                                        2.864 \\n                                                                        12.051 \\n                                                                        22.138 \\n                                                                        33.125 \\n                                                                        45.012 \\n                                                                        57.799 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                        IX. Beschikbaar budgettair resultaat \\n                                                                        2.864 \\n                                                                        12.051 \\n                                                                        22.138 \\n                                                                        33.125 \\n                                                                        45.012 \\n                                                                        57.799 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                 \\n                                                             \\n                                                              \\n                                                            \\n                                                                 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                 \\n                                                                 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                        Autofinancieringsmarge \\n                                                                        2026 \\n                                                                        2027 \\n                                                                        2028 \\n                                                                        2029 \\n                                                                        2030 \\n                                                                        2031 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                        I. Exploitatiesaldo \\n                                                                        257.485 \\n                                                                        258.385 \\n                                                                        259.285 \\n                                                                        260.185 \\n                                                                        261.085 \\n                                                                        261.985 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                        II. Netto periodieke aflossingen \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                     \\n                                                                            a. Periodieke aflossingen conform de verbintenissen \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198 \\n                                                                        249.198